{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>Ho.</b> Woe, to rebellious children." "<b>And not of me.</b> And not from me. So too שעו מני (Isaiah 22:4)." "<b>And to pour a covering.</b> Like והמסכה (Isaiah 25:7). The sense is a parable about the counsel." "<b>And not of my spirit.</b> The sense is from my prophecy."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:55:54.316346550Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}